# Every change to KUI needs a review from the maintainer. Branch protection on
# main has "Require review from Code Owners" on, so approvals from anyone not
# listed here don't count toward merging.
#
# The last matching pattern wins, so the explicit entries below only document
# the files that matter most; they resolve to the same owner as the catch-all.
*                               @tructn

# Release-please's release PR edits these. Merging that PR publishes a release.
/CHANGELOG.md                   @tructn
/package.json                   @tructn
/src-tauri/Cargo.toml           @tructn
/src-tauri/Cargo.lock           @tructn
/release-please-config.json     @tructn
/.release-please-manifest.json  @tructn

# Release pipeline, updater signing config, and this file.
/.github/                       @tructn
/src-tauri/tauri.conf.json      @tructn
